en.latex:
\begin{aligned}
Pr(x) &= \sum_{n=1}^{N} Pr(x, z=n) \\
&= \sum_{n=1}^{N} Pr(x \mid z=n) \cdot Pr(z=n) \\
&= \sum_{n=1}^{N} \lambda_n \cdot \mathrm{Norm}_x\!\left[\mu_n, \sigma_n^2\right].
\end{aligned}

